    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "W88820",
      "San Francisco's Golden Gate is only a few enjoyable\nhours from Hawaii by swift, comfortable Flying Clip-\nper. Pan American World Airways _offers direct daily\nservice from Los Angeles and San Francisco to Hono-\nlulu, and regular, frequent service beyond to Auckland\nSydney, Manila, the Orient and on around the world\nto New York.\nP35 - 13\nPRINTED IN U.B.A.\nTHE SYSTEM OF THE FLYING CLIPPERS\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nADDRESS"
